Ex.No:1: Simulation of FDMA in MATLAB
Objective 2:

clc; clear; close all; 
BW = 200;                      
Users = 3; 
M = 2;                         
DataRate = BW*log2(M);         
Rate = DataRate*ones(1,Users); 
disp(' User   Data Rate (kbps)')
disp([(1:Users)' Rate'])
bar(1:Users,Rate)
xlabel('Users')
ylabel('Data Rate (kbps)')
title('FDMA Data Rate for Each User')
grid on

